{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ReAct vs Plan-and-Execute 两种设计模式有什么区别？如何选择？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的两种主流设计模式 ReAct 和 Plan-and-Execute 有什么区别？各自适用于什么场景？生产中如何结合使用？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心区别：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>ReAct</th>\n<th>Plan-and-Execute</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核心思路</strong></td>\n<td>边思考、边调用工具、边观察</td>\n<td>先生成整体计划，再按步骤执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>规划方式</strong></td>\n<td>每步即时决策，无全局计划</td>\n<td>执行前生成完整计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>灵活性</strong></td>\n<td>高，每步可根据观察调整</td>\n<td>低，计划一旦生成按序执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>一致性</strong></td>\n<td>可能跑偏，缺乏全局视角</td>\n<td>全局规划，步骤间依赖清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>执行效率</strong></td>\n<td>每步需 LLM 决策，较慢</td>\n<td>计划阶段一次决策，执行快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>适用场景</strong></td>\n<td>开放式探索、工具调用不确定</td>\n<td>流程型任务、步骤有强依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>典型案例</strong></td>\n<td>查订单、查天气、问答</td>\n<td>数据分析报告、项目管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct 的详细流程：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">ReAct: 每步都 Thought → Action → Observation\n\n用户：\"帮我查一下明天北京天气，如果是雨天，推荐室内活动\"\n\nStep 1: Thought → 需要查北京明天天气 → Action: search(\"北京明天天气\") \n         → Observation: \"小雨 18-22°C\"\n         \nStep 2: Thought → 是雨天，需要推荐室内活动 → Action: search(\"北京室内活动推荐\") \n         → Observation: \"博物馆、密室逃脱、购物中心...\"\n         \nStep 3: Thought → 信息足够，生成最终回答 → Final Answer\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Plan-and-Execute 的详细流程：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Plan-and-Execute: 先全局规划，再逐步执行\n\n用户：\"帮我查一下明天北京天气，如果是雨天，推荐室内活动\"\n\nPlan 阶段:\n  1. 查询北京明天天气\n  2. 判断是否需要室内活动推荐\n  3. 如果需要，搜索室内活动\n  4. 整合信息，生成回复\n\nExecute 阶段:\n  Step 1: 执行\"查询天气\" → \"小雨\"\n  Step 2: 执行\"判断\" → \"需要推荐\"\n  Step 3: 执行\"搜索室内活动\" → \"博物馆、密室逃脱...\"\n  Step 4: 整合生成回复\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码对比：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># ===== ReAct 实现 =====</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ReActAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"边想边做，每步都重新决策\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"任务：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 每步都重新思考</span>\n            thought <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n思考下一步：\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n选择行动：\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_complete<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate_answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> context\n\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ===== Plan-and-Execute 实现 =====</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">PlanAndExecuteAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"先规划再执行\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第一阶段：生成完整计划</span>\n        plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"为以下任务制定计划：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        steps <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parse_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第二阶段：按顺序执行</span>\n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 可选：根据结果重新规划</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>needs_replan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                steps <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>replan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 整合结果</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>synthesize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>混合策略（最佳实践）：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">生产中最好的做法是<strong>混合使用</strong>：Plan-and-Execute 做全局规划，ReAct 做每步内的灵活执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HybridAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    混合策略：Plan-and-Execute 做全局规划 + ReAct 做局部灵活执行\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Plan 阶段：全局规划</span>\n        plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"全局计划：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 每个步骤内部用 ReAct 灵活执行</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>requires_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                react_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>react_execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>react_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 简单步骤直接执行</span>\n                result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>direct_execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 动态评估是否需要重新规划</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>should_replan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>replan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>synthesize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">react_execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Step<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"对复杂步骤使用 ReAct 灵活执行\"\"\"</span>\n        react_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ReActAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_steps<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> react_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>选择建议：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>用 ReAct</strong>：当任务步骤不确定、需要根据中间结果灵活调整（如探索性搜索、故障排查）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>用 Plan-and-Execute</strong>：当步骤之间有强依赖、执行顺序基本固定（如生成报告、数据处理流程）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>用混合策略</strong>：复杂项目中，全局用 Plan-and-Execute，局部复杂步骤用 ReAct</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：两种模式在 Token 消耗上有什么差异？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：ReAct 每步都需 LLM 重新思考，Token 消耗更大；Plan-and-Execute 计划阶段一次性消耗较多 Token，但执行阶段更高效。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：如果 Plan 阶段生成的计划有错误怎么办？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：引入 Replanner 机制，在执行过程中根据反馈动态调整计划（如 LangGraph 中的 Replan 节点）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：两种模式必须二选一</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：实战中多数采用混合策略，取长补短。面试中被逼二选一时，提出混合方案是加分项</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}